{"id":69563,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69563"},"modified":"2026-11-08T13:55:19","modified_gmt":"2026-11-08T12:55:19","slug":"meia-maratona-de-sesimbra","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-sesimbra\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>21 de fevereiro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Sesimbra Natura Park<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Sesimbra<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>Xistarca<\/strong> num cen\u00e1rio privilegiado rodeado de pinhais, charcas e natureza preservada, a prova proporciona uma experi\u00eancia atl\u00e9tica revigorante \u00e0s portas da \u00c1rea Metropolitana de Lisboa.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo inicia-se \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> com a <strong>Kids Race (500 m)<\/strong> dedicada aos jovens praticantes, seguindo-se a <strong>Meia Maratona (21 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:00<\/strong>, a <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:30<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>10:35<\/strong>. Desenhados em piso de terra batida e caminhos rurais no interior da herdade, os percursos contam com postos de abastecimento aos 5 km, 10 km, 15 km e na meta, marcadores de ritmo (pacers dos 4:00 min\/km aos 6:00 min\/km), cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip no dorsal (21 km e 10 km), t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e medalha de finalista.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online em cinco fases de antecipa\u00e7\u00e3o (at\u00e9 7 de dezembro, 25 de janeiro, 15 de fevereiro, 18 de fevereiro e \u00faltima hora). A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura parque de estacionamento gratuito no interior do recinto, servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa e entrega pr\u00e9via do kit de participante nos dias 19 de fevereiro (em Lisboa, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00) e 20 de fevereiro (no Sesimbra Natura Park, das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00), n\u00e3o existindo levantamento de dorsais no pr\u00f3prio dia do evento. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21 de Fevereiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Sesimbra Natura Park, Sesimbra, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14p