ext-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada \u2013 5 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:35<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Race \u2013 500 m<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Fev \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no dia 21 de fevereiro de 2027 (Domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada no Sesimbra Natura Park, no concelho de Sesimbra, distrito de Set\u00fabal.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das corridas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09:30 com a Kids Race de 500 m, seguindo-se a Meia Maratona de 21 km \u00e0s 10:00, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 10:30 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10:35.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais e kit de participante?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A entrega decorre na sexta-feira, 19 de fevereiro de 2027 (das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00), nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Xistarca em Lisboa (Cal\u00e7ada da Tapada, 71A), e no s\u00e1bado, 20 de fevereiro (das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00), no Sesimbra Natura Park. N\u00e3o existe levantamento de dorsais no pr\u00f3prio dia do evento.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Existe estacionamento, pacers e guarda-roupa no local?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, os participantes disp\u00f5em de estacionamento gratuito no interior do Sesimbra Natura Park, servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa junto \u00e0 partida\/meta e marcadores de ritmo (pacers entre 4:00 min\/km e 6:00 min\/km) nas provas de 21 km e 10 km.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais os valores da Meia Maratona de Sesimbra?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel no topo desta p\u00e1gina, com valores escalonados em cinco fases: 14,00 \u20ac a 28,00 \u20ac na Meia Maratona (21 km), 10,00 \u20ac a 20,00 \u20ac na Corrida (10 km), 8,00 \u20ac a 18,00 \u20ac na Caminhada (5 km) e 4,00 \u20ac a 10,00 \u20ac na Kids Race (500 m).<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Sesimbra Natura Park, Sesimbra, Set\u00fabal\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sesimbra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Set\u00fabal\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A Meia Maratona de Sesimbra realiza-se a 21 de fevereiro de 2027. Percursos de 21 km, 10 km, 5 km e Kids Race no Sesimbra Natura Park. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-sesimbra.webp\"]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a Meia Maratona de Sesimbra 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no dia 21 de fevereiro de 2027 (Domingo), com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada no Sesimbra Natura Park, no concelho de Sesimbra, distrito de Set\u00fabal.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das corridas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inicia-se \u00e0s 09:30 com a Kids Race de 500 m, seguindo-se a Meia Maratona de 21 km \u00e0s 10:00, a Corrida de 10 km \u00e0s 10:30 e a Caminhada de 5 km \u00e0s 10:35.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento dos dorsais e kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A entrega decorre na sexta-feira, 19 de fevereiro de 2027 (das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00), nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Xistarca em Lisboa (Cal\u00e7ada da Tapada, 71A), e no s\u00e1bado, 20 de fevereiro (das 10:00 \u00e0s 18:00), no Sesimbra Natura Park. N\u00e3o existe levantamento de dorsais no pr\u00f3prio dia do evento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Existe estacionamento, pacers e guarda-roupa no local?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, os participantes disp\u00f5em de estacionamento gratuito no interior do Sesimbra Natura Park, servi\u00e7o de guarda-roupa junto \u00e0 partida\/meta e marcadores de ritmo (pacers entre 4:00 min\/km e 6:00 min\/km) nas provas de 21 km e 10 km.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como efetuar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e quais os valores da Meia Maratona de Sesimbra?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dispon\u00edvel no topo desta p\u00e1gina, com valores escalonados em cinco fases: 14,00 \u20ac a 28,00 \u20ac na Meia Maratona (21 km), 10,00 \u20ac a 20,00 \u20ac na Corrida (10 km), 8,00 \u20ac a 18,00 \u20ac na Caminhada (5 km) e 4,00 \u20ac a 10,00 \u20ac na Kids Race (500 m).\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69565,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,624,41],"event_type_2":[728,820,48],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-69563","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sesimbra-setubal","event_organizer-xistarca","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-kids","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-setubal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-meia-maratona-de-sesimbra.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/69563","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\